<body>

<header>

<h2>🎨 PINK CITY COLOUR PAINT</h2>

<h1>Diwali Se Pehle Ghar Ko Naya Look</h1>

<p>Professional Home Painting Services in Jaipur</p>

<a class="btn"
href="https://wa.me/917790889067?text=Hello%20Pink%20City%20Colour%20Paint%2C%20mujhe%20painting%20ka%20quotation%20chahiye."
target="_blank">
📲 WhatsApp Enquiry
